/P 345 0 R
/E ([A] M&C - Harvesting a generational EPCI super-cycle: PVS is entering a peak execution cycle supported by domestic upstream projects \(Appendix 9\), while PDP8 creates a long-term growth runway for its fabrication and offshore construction capabilities \(Figure 21\). Together, these drivers are expected to sustain strong M&C growth through FY2028 \(Appendix 13\).)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
612 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 345 0 R
/E (THESIS 1: MULTI-SEGMENT MOMENTUM AND STRUCTURAL MARGIN EXPANSION)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
613 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 345 0 R
/E ([A] Strong basis funding future investment within new cycles: PVS possesses highly flexible capital reallocation capabilities with high cash available, providing funds for CAPEX demands increase in 2027, where projects are expected to be finished. Also, significant cash offers rooms for increases in financial incomes. \(Appendix 9\))
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
