619 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 345 0 R
/E ([A] Accelerating APAC offshore wind deployment drives surging component demand: APAC offshore wind installations are projected to grow at a 26.9% CAGR \(Appendix 12\), driving strong demand for offshore substation and foundation components. Supply chain constraints and supplier diversification efforts are expected to create significant opportunities for regional fabricators.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
620 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 345 0 R
/E (THESIS 3: ABILITIES TO CAPTURE THE NEW GROWING SEGMENT - OFFSHORE WIND)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
621 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 345 0 R
/E ([B] Favorable policies enhance market visibility: Easing local content requirements in key markets and Vietnam's PDP8 roadmap \(Figure 21\) improve long-term visibility for offshore wind fabrication demand. These policy tailwinds should support sustained growth opportunities for the regional supply chain.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
622 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 345 0 R
/E ([C] PTSC advantageous position to capture offshore wind opportunities: Leveraging transferable O&G expertise, large-scale fabrication infrastructure \(Appendix 10\), competitive labor costs \(Appendix 14\) and a proven execution track record \(Appendix 15\), the company is well positioned to secure international contracts while maintaining high quality standards.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
623 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 345 0 R
/E ([B] FSO/FPSO - High-margin defensive anchor: The FSO/FPSO fleet provides stable, high-margin earnings through long-term contracts that protect earnings from oil price volatility \(Appendix 13\). The scheduled deployment of two new units is expected to increase the recurring profit base by approximately 30% \(Appendix 8\).)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
624 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 345 0 R
/E ([C] Port & Base - High-leverage strategic gateway: Supported by its unique heavy-fabrication handling capabilities \(Appendix 10\), the segment is evolving into a key logistics hub serving domestic megaprojects and regional offshore wind staging.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
