/E (We sensitise our valuation across two dimensions to assess the robustness of our recommendation. As the two primary determinants of terminal value, we flex WACC and Terminal Growth Rate \(g\) simultaneously around our base case of 10.67% and 8.00% respectively \(Figure 38\). The implied price range is VND 38,188-130,177, supporting our BUY recommendation while a modest improvement in either assumption yields meaningfully higher upside.)
