/E (To further stress-test beyond the two-dimensional tables above, we ran a Monte Carlo simulation across 10,000 scenarios by simultaneously randomizing all four drivers \(1\) revenue growth, \(2\) WACC, \(3\) EBITDA margin and \(4\) terminal growth rate \(Figure 37\). Across all valid scenarios, 81.2% return an intrinsic value above market price and 61.0% exceed the DCF base case of VND 49,770. Revenue growth \(r = +0.65\) and EBITDA Margin \(r = +0.33\) emerge as the two dominant value drivers, consistent with the sensitivity findings above \(Appendix 20\).)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [22]
