762 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 349 0 R
/T ([O1] - EPC/EPCI Contract Execution Risk: Under lump-sum EPCI structures, cost escalation and schedule overruns are absorbed entirely by PVS - a structural hazard of the industry that the majority of offshore projects miss sanctioned cost and schedule targets at completion \(Appendix 24, Appendix 25\). Valuation: A 2pp EBITDA margin compression from a single mid-size overrun reduces our target price by 1.75%. Mitigation: Tighten subcontractor pre-qualification and progress toward Target Cost/Gain-Share structures on technically novel contracts, supported by comprehensive project insurance \(performance bond, marine all-risk\).)
/E ([O1] - EPC/EPCI Contract Execution Risk: Under lump-sum EPCI structures, cost escalation and schedule overruns are absorbed entirely by PVS - a structural hazard of the industry that the majority of offshore projects miss sanctioned cost and schedule targets at completion \(Appendix 24, Appendix 25\). Valuation: A 2pp EBITDA margin compression from a single mid-size overrun reduces our target price by 1.75%. Mitigation: Tighten subcontractor pre-qualification and progress toward Target Cost/Gain-Share structures on technically novel contracts, supported by comprehensive project insurance \(performance bond, marine all-risk\).)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
