>>
endobj
1072 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 357 0 R
/E (Debt forecast: Total debt is modeled using a stable D/E ratio of ~0.58x, reflecting PVS's conservative capital structure. Backed by a VND 11,584.69 cash balance, future mega-projects \(Block B, Lac Da Vang\) will be funded via internal cash generation rather than new external leverage.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
1073 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 357 0 R
/E (Cost of debt: Reconstructed from historical interest expense/total debt, pre-tax cost of debt is adjusted forward-looking to a flat 7.80% over the forecast horizon. )
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
