/P 358 0 R
/T (We constructed bull and bear case scenarios using a separate set of assumptions to consider possible deviations from our base case valuation. Drivers of divergence include: 1\) oil price movements affecting PVN's upstream capex appetite, 2\) execution pace on project pipeline, 3\) M&C contract mix and overhead absorption, and 4\) input cost and procurement dynamics within the SOE framework.)
/E (We constructed bull and bear case scenarios using a separate set of assumptions to consider possible deviations from our base case valuation. Drivers of divergence include: 1\) oil price movements affecting PVN's upstream capex appetite, 2\) execution pace on project pipeline, 3\) M&C contract mix and overhead absorption, and 4\) input cost and procurement dynamics within the SOE framework.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [4]
>>
