/Title (Bull case: PVS benefits from a favourable upstream investment cycle underpinned by Brent above USD 85/bbl and accelerated PVN capital deployment. PVS wins incremental international tenders and expands its JV pipeline, capitalising on the regional energy transition capex wave. A more accommodative rate environment compresses WACC to 9.67%, while terminal growth is maintained at 8.00%, consistent with PVS's alignment with Vietnam's National Energy Master Plan. The combined effect implies 53,873 VND/share \(+41.77%\).)
